WEBVTT

01:24.060 --> 01:29.980
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

01:35.850 --> 01:38.970
<i>I am Ranger Daybreak Pink.</i>

01:39.670 --> 01:40.820
Transform.

02:00.090 --> 02:03.530
<i>I will defeat the Evil League, 
which threatens Earth.</i>

02:03.530 --> 02:05.380
<i>That's my job.</i>

02:08.290 --> 02:11.570
<i>Every day I patrol, and occasionally I fight.</i>

02:13.880 --> 02:16.850
<i>Again and again, I send 
enemies flying with my strikes.</i>

02:24.510 --> 02:26.280
<i>I've had enough...</i>

02:26.280 --> 02:29.760
<i>of this hero suit that's 
like full-body tights,</i>

02:29.760 --> 02:32.390
<i>and of this knock-down, 
drag-out fighting style.</i>

02:34.750 --> 02:37.990
<i>Because the truth is...</i>

02:53.600 --> 02:55.790
They're so cute.

02:55.790 --> 02:59.790
The truth is that I always wanted 
to be a magical girl!

02:56.980 --> 03:00.990
Magical Girl Angel Anima

03:06.920 --> 03:08.070
Stupid!

03:08.070 --> 03:10.240
You could never pull that look off!
For shame!

03:19.310 --> 03:22.420
This is Daybreak Pink. Enemies eliminated.

03:22.930 --> 03:24.830
I'm returning to my patrol.

03:26.510 --> 03:30.020
Magical Girl Angel Anima

03:26.510 --> 03:30.020
Magical Girl Angel Anima

03:30.440 --> 03:33.830
<i>Yeah, I'm just not suited for it.</i>

03:38.110 --> 03:39.140
It's gone...

03:39.470 --> 03:43.690
<i>The keychain I bought because 
I'm so into magical girl wands!</i>

03:43.690 --> 03:46.630
<i>I had it in my purse as a good-luck charm.</i>

03:46.630 --> 03:49.080
<i>Maybe it fell out when I was shopping?</i>

03:50.200 --> 03:52.740
Blue, are you going out to collect Red?

03:52.740 --> 03:54.410
You're not going to wait for Black?

03:54.410 --> 03:55.240
That's right.

03:56.290 --> 03:58.390
Pink, what're you doing?

03:58.390 --> 03:59.740
Ugh, Blue.

03:59.740 --> 04:00.410
Huh?

04:00.620 --> 04:03.340
Oh, you're wearing glasses today.

04:03.840 --> 04:08.950
<i>I </i>know<i> this guy would make fun of me if 
he found out I had magical girl swag.</i>

04:09.890 --> 04:11.980
Not that it's any of your business.

04:11.980 --> 04:15.680
What? You know, you never show 
so much as a shred of cuteness.

04:19.480 --> 04:23.220
Then why not just deal with Red? <i>He's</i> cute.

04:23.220 --> 04:24.410
Huh?

04:24.410 --> 04:25.670
This is exactly what I'm talking—

04:25.670 --> 04:27.750
Ow!

04:29.710 --> 04:32.370
That was bad of both of you.

04:32.370 --> 04:36.380
But you should think a little more 
before you open your mouth, Blue.

04:36.380 --> 04:37.460
Shame on you.

04:37.830 --> 04:39.810
Ow!

04:41.750 --> 04:44.540
Pink, are you about to go out?

04:44.540 --> 04:47.940
It's almost time for Black's patrol.

04:47.940 --> 04:50.190
Blue can go collect Red.

04:51.890 --> 04:53.910
I won't cause any trouble.

05:01.630 --> 05:06.530
<i>I know better than anyone 
that I'm devoid of cuteness.</i>

05:08.940 --> 05:09.810
It's not here...

05:10.170 --> 05:11.330
Or here...

05:18.250 --> 05:19.970
It's not here either.

05:31.010 --> 05:32.720
I'll leave soon.

05:43.330 --> 05:44.860
<i>It's nowhere to be found.</i>

05:47.110 --> 05:49.630
<i>And the shop is closed now.</i>

05:49.880 --> 05:51.140
<i>That leaves...</i>

05:52.370 --> 05:55.500
<b>Unohara Police Box</b>

05:52.910 --> 05:55.060
Um, excuse me.

05:55.960 --> 05:57.320
There it is!

05:59.870 --> 06:03.750
<b>Beware suspicious phone calls!</b>

05:59.880 --> 06:03.760
Someone only just came by to drop it off.

06:04.620 --> 06:08.620
They <i>just</i> walked out the door, 
so they might still be nearby—

06:08.950 --> 06:12.560
Look for someone tall in a trench coat!

06:17.200 --> 06:18.780
I'm home!

06:18.780 --> 06:21.730
Today I made it back all by myself!

06:22.980 --> 06:25.310
What's wrong with you two?

06:25.310 --> 06:29.130
If Pink turns to crime, it's Blue's fault.

06:28.820 --> 06:30.570
ache   ache   ache   ache   ache   ache   ache

06:30.570 --> 06:33.580
