07:22.980 --> 07:24.340
Wait up!

07:30.330 --> 07:32.790
Are you the one who turned this in?

07:32.790 --> 07:35.850
Yes. You're the owner, I take it?

07:36.300 --> 07:37.720
I, um...

07:38.590 --> 07:40.620
