07:41.050 --> 07:44.860
Take care not to lose
 the things you treasure...

07:48.390 --> 07:50.350
Miss Magical Girl.

07:59.920 --> 08:02.030
What's with him?

08:03.500 --> 08:06.820
Does he know about <i>Magical Girl Angel Anima</i>?

08:10.610 --> 08:18.420
<i>That's actually what I've always 
wanted to be called instead of a Ranger.</i>

08:25.440 --> 08:28.560
I'd better put this away so I don't lose it.

08:30.460 --> 08:31.350
Hey.

08:36.180 --> 08:39.390
Don't walk around by yourself at this hour.

08:39.390 --> 08:41.570
Everyone's worried about you.

08:42.100 --> 08:43.930
Find what you were looking for?

08:44.700 --> 08:46.170
I did.

08:47.400 --> 08:48.330
Okay.

08:49.180 --> 08:50.450
Let's go home.

08:51.630 --> 08:53.280
You'll stretch out my sleeve.

08:53.280 --> 08:54.970
Then start walking.

