16:14.440 --> 16:16.520
<i>Today is my day off.</i>

16:23.610 --> 16:29.260
<i>When work gets busy, I inevitably 
end up neglecting things at home.</i>

16:29.610 --> 16:31.400
<i>And so, today is...</i>

16:35.610 --> 16:37.430
<i>all about cleaning.</i>

16:42.160 --> 16:49.030
<i>I heard that with vacuums, the suction is 
stronger when you pull than when you push.</i>

16:50.620 --> 16:54.220
<i>Dust bunnies readily form 
in the corners of rooms.</i>

16:54.660 --> 16:56.530
<i>You've got to be thorough.</i>

17:31.870 --> 17:33.010
There.

17:37.030 --> 17:39.020
Might as well reorganize, too.

17:40.130 --> 17:43.320
That reminds me... 
I'm almost out of detergent.

17:45.840 --> 17:48.250
I can throw out this stuff down here.

17:52.050 --> 17:54.550
<b>The box is empty</b>

18:07.930 --> 18:09.420
I'll hang on to it...

18:34.300 --> 18:36.490
<i>Time for a little break.</i>

18:37.130 --> 18:39.890
<b>Panda just eats bamboo</b>

18:43.590 --> 18:49.100
<i>They uploaded a special video 
shot by the zookeepers?!</i>

18:43.600 --> 18:49.100
<b>Just filmed! Special video by the zookeepers</b>

18:43.600 --> 18:49.100
<b>I tried making rice balls that look like pandas from behind!</b>

19:29.490 --> 19:31.010
What nice weather.

19:31.010 --> 19:33.930
I'm glad I hung the laundry out to dry.

19:42.410 --> 19:44.610
<i>This creature...</i>

19:46.210 --> 19:48.450
<i>Animalia. Chordata.</i>

19:48.450 --> 19:50.940
<i>Vertebrata. Mammalia.</i>

19:50.940 --> 19:53.110
<i>Carnivora. Feliformia.</i>

19:53.110 --> 19:55.200
<i>Felidae. Felis.</i>

19:55.200 --> 19:56.450
<i>A cat!</i>

19:58.960 --> 20:05.220
<i>This creature's standoffish attitude and 
charm have made it a favorite with Earthlings.</i>

20:05.550 --> 20:08.280
<i>That favor is a weakness!</i>

20:08.280 --> 20:12.900
<i>If we win them over to our side, 
they should prove a valuable asset.</i>

20:13.130 --> 20:17.320
<i>And this cat's coat resembles 
a panda's to boot.</i>

20:21.000 --> 20:24.490
Hey, cat. Nice weather we're having, huh?

20:31.160 --> 20:33.840
<i>It won't even look my way.</i>

20:33.840 --> 20:36.790
<i>But all the better, Earthlings.</i>

20:36.790 --> 20:39.060
<i>I shall not be dissuaded.</i>

20:41.330 --> 20:44.160
<i>We're newcomers to this world.</i>

20:44.160 --> 20:49.080
<i>Perhaps I sounded too rude to one 
who has dwelt here for eons.</i>

20:49.080 --> 20:50.040
<i>In other words...</i>

20:51.270 --> 20:54.320
Isn't today's weather
 simply delightful, Mr. Cat?

20:54.320 --> 20:56.990
<i>How'd you like that, feline?!</i>

20:59.990 --> 21:01.940
<i>I earned a glance!</i>

21:01.940 --> 21:03.770
<i>Did you see that, Earthlings?!</i>

21:08.840 --> 21:13.140
<i>O-Oh, of course. It has a different language.</i>

21:13.140 --> 21:16.870
<i>That's so obvious. 
How could I have forgotten?</i>

21:17.120 --> 21:23.450
<i>This cat has been sitting here listening 
to my unintelligible babble!</i>

21:23.450 --> 21:25.270
<i>How generous in spirit it must be!</i>

21:25.620 --> 21:28.690
<i>I must respond in good faith.</i>

21:47.070 --> 21:50.030
